### List matches on a date (WIB)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matches?date=14.09.2026

### Match detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Live updates (Server-Sent Events); keep open
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/matches/stream
Accept: text/event-stream

### Standings (season defaults to the latest)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/standings
